# dirtbench, machine-local settings. Written on first run, never shipped: an
# install path is true of one machine only.
#
# Grammar: one `key = value` a line, `#` starts a comment, values are unquoted
# and run to the end of the line. src/app/config.odin has the rest.
#
# install_dir is the game folder — the one holding dirt3_game.exe. The project
# manager's top line writes it for you, so this is here to be read, not edited.

# install_dir = /path/to/DiRT 3 Complete Edition
